# Story 1-1, a dive to the right with the mouse turning 3 degrees per sample from sample 250 to 399:
# run from 240, Cross at 262, the stick let go at 300. Take-off 262-268, in the air to about 363, on the ground to
# about 382 (the samples differ a little by direction). Stop at frame 450. 30 game frames per second.
scheme dual_analog
40 0x4000 128 128
43 0x0 128 128
60 0x4000 128 128
63 0x0 128 128
80 0x4000 128 128
83 0x0 128 128
100 0x4000 128 128
103 0x0 128 128
120 0x4000 128 128
123 0x0 128 128
140 0x4000 128 128
143 0x0 128 128
160 0x4000 128 128
163 0x0 128 128
180 0x4000 128 128
183 0x0 128 128
200 0x4000 128 128
203 0x0 128 128
240 0x0 255 128 128 128
250 0x0 255 128 128 128 3 0
262 0x4000 255 128 128 128 3 0
264 0x0 255 128 128 128 3 0
300 0x0 128 128 128 128 3 0
400 0x0 128 128 128 128
end 410
